VideoMaker — OpenMontage derivative
===================================

This repository is a derivative of OpenMontage, an open-source agentic
video production system.

  Upstream: https://github.com/calesthio/OpenMontage
  Imported commit: 08e2151fa02de28a5d6a312b3d575692bf147ad7
  ("docs: add Objects in Overdrive video showcase")

